        {
          "text": "Iblahimu nkutangola kavila kuchidoni, “Chonde Nang'olo unangusunalile, leka ngutangole kavila. Dachi vakàpwawa chihi vanu salasini vatênda haki?” Yahwe nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Nikambetenda uchocho nikàvakoja anevo vanu salasini.”",
